title: "Exchange Trade-Record Forensics"
abstract: "Code implementing the tests of a forensic sequence for suspect parts of an exchange's self-reported trade record: Benford digit tests, benchmark comparison with a seeded bootstrap, a non-digit trade-size cross-check, placebo windows, and a script that reproduces the published values from Binance's public trade record."
